{"title":"Career Roadmap · Cath-Lab Technologist","role":"Cath-Lab Technologist","summary":"A Cath-Lab Technologist is an allied-health professional who supports cardiac catheterization and interventional cardiovascular procedures. The role involves preparing the cath lab, assisting the clinical team, operating and monitoring specialized equipment within the technologist's scope, maintaining sterile technique, preparing patients and supplies, documenting procedures, and supporting emergency response.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Cath-Lab Technologist is an allied-health professional who supports cardiac catheterization and interventional cardiovascular procedures. The role involves preparing the cath lab, assisting the clinical team, operating and monitoring specialized equipment within the technologist's scope, maintaining sterile technique, preparing patients and supplies, documenting procedures, and supporting emergency response."},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the direct undergraduate pathway should be a recognized program specifically aligned with Cardiac Care Technology / Cardiovascular Technology / Cath-Lab Technology / Cardiac Catheterization Technology or an equivalent recognized program. A generic BPT, BOT, BMLT, or other allied-health degree does not automatically qualify for cath-lab technologist positions. Exact eligibility and scope depend on the recognized qualification, employer, and applicable rules."},{"type":"p","text":"The profession combines cardiology + invasive-procedure support + imaging technology + hemodynamic monitoring + sterile technique + emergency care. Future cath-lab technologists will increasingly work with advanced imaging, structural-heart interventions, electrophysiology workflows, robotics, digital hemodynamics, and AI-assisted procedural systems."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build strong foundations in cardiovascular anatomy, physiology, ECG, patient care, sterile technique, cath-lab equipment, hemodynamics, emergency response, and supervised clinical procedures."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work as a Cath-Lab Technologist and develop expertise in coronary angiography, PCI support, hemodynamic monitoring, contrast procedures, and cardiovascular emergencies."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward senior technologist, specialist cath-lab technologist, structural-heart support, electrophysiology, quality/safety, or clinical applications roles."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward cath-lab leadership, clinical applications, cardiovascular technology management, education, research, or advanced interventional-technology roles."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the UG Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Cardiovascular & Clinical Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build the medical foundation required for cardiovascular procedures."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human anatomy"},{"text":"Human physiology"},{"text":"Pathology"},{"text":"Microbiology"},{"text":"Pharmacology fundamentals"},{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Patient care"},{"text":"First aid"},{"text":"Infection prevention"},{"text":"Professional ethics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heart anatomy"},{"text":"Cardiac chambers"},{"text":"Coronary arteries"},{"text":"Cardiac conduction system"},{"text":"Cardiac cycle"},{"text":"Blood pressure"},{"text":"Cardiac output"},{"text":"Vascular anatomy"},{"text":"Peripheral circulation"},{"text":"Basic cardiovascular pathology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Cardiac Technology & Cath-Lab Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Begin developing specialized technical knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"ECG & Cardiac Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ECG fundamentals"},{"text":"12-lead ECG"},{"text":"Heart rate and rhythm"},{"text":"Basic arrhythmia recognition"},{"text":"Cardiac monitoring"},{"text":"Pulse oximetry"},{"text":"Blood pressure monitoring"},{"text":"Invasive pressure monitoring fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The technologist should recognize abnormal findings and escalate them to the appropriate clinical team, rather than independently diagnosing patients."},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Environment"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the structure and workflow of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cath laboratory"},{"text":"Control room"},{"text":"Procedure room"},{"text":"Sterile area"},{"text":"Patient preparation area"},{"text":"Recovery area"},{"text":"Equipment storage"},{"text":"Radiation-controlled areas"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic Workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Arrival"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Identification"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Consent & Preparation"},{"type":"h","text":"Sterile Preparation"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Setup"},{"type":"h","text":"Procedure"},{"type":"h","text":"Hemodynamic Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-Procedure Care"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation & Transfer"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Interventional Cardiology Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop supervised clinical competency."},{"type":"h","text":"Coronary Procedures"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the workflow of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coronary angiography"},{"text":"Percutaneous coronary intervention (PCI)"},{"text":"Balloon angioplasty"},{"text":"Coronary stenting"},{"text":"Coronary pressure assessment"},{"text":"Intravascular imaging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important Technologies"},{"type":"h","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"C-arm fluoroscopy"},{"text":"Digital subtraction concepts"},{"text":"Hemodynamic monitoring systems"},{"text":"Contrast injectors"},{"text":"ECG monitoring"},{"text":"Defibrillators"},{"text":"Temporary pacing equipment"},{"text":"Intra-aortic balloon pump fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Hemodynamic Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop practical knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Arterial pressure"},{"text":"Central venous pressure"},{"text":"Right atrial pressure"},{"text":"Right ventricular pressure"},{"text":"Pulmonary artery pressure"},{"text":"Pulmonary capillary wedge pressure"},{"text":"Aortic pressure"},{"text":"Left ventricular pressure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pressure waveforms"},{"text":"Zeroing"},{"text":"Leveling"},{"text":"Transducer setup"},{"text":"Artifact recognition"},{"text":"Basic waveform interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Pressure Transducer"},{"type":"h","text":"Zero & Level"},{"type":"h","text":"Connect to Patient"},{"type":"h","text":"Pressure Waveform"},{"type":"h","text":"Monitor"},{"type":"h","text":"Record Data"},{"type":"h","text":"Escalate Abnormal Findings"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Advanced Cath-Lab Clinical Training"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should emphasize supervised hands-on exposure."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop Competency In"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cath-lab preparation"},{"text":"Patient positioning"},{"text":"Sterile assistance"},{"text":"Equipment preparation"},{"text":"Contrast-media workflow"},{"text":"Hemodynamic monitoring"},{"text":"Radiation safety"},{"text":"Emergency response"},{"text":"Procedure documentation"},{"text":"Equipment troubleshooting"},{"text":"Post-procedure transfer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sterile Technique"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important professional skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Surgical hand preparation"},{"text":"Sterile gowning"},{"text":"Sterile gloving"},{"text":"Draping"},{"text":"Maintaining sterile fields"},{"text":"Instrument handling"},{"text":"Contamination prevention"},{"text":"Infection-control procedures"},{"text":"Sharps safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Remember"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Sterile Technique"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Equipment Readiness"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Team Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Safe Cath-Lab Procedure"},{"type":"h","text":"Interventional Cardiology Procedures"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain theoretical and supervised clinical exposure to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Coronary"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diagnostic coronary angiography"},{"text":"PCI"},{"text":"Balloon angioplasty"},{"text":"Stent placement"},{"text":"Chronic total occlusion procedures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Structural Heart"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the workflow of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TAVR/TAVI"},{"text":"Mitral interventions"},{"text":"Left atrial appendage closure"},{"text":"Septal interventions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Peripheral Interventions"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Peripheral angiography"},{"text":"Peripheral angioplasty"},{"text":"Peripheral stenting"},{"text":"Vascular interventions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact responsibilities of the technologist depend on institutional scope and training."},{"type":"h","text":"Electrophysiology Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"A cath-lab technologist can benefit from understanding electrophysiology."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn the basics of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiac conduction"},{"text":"Arrhythmias"},{"text":"Electrophysiology studies"},{"text":"Catheter mapping"},{"text":"Ablation"},{"text":"Temporary pacing"},{"text":"Permanent pacemaker implantation"},{"text":"ICD implantation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Potential later specialization:"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab + Electrophysiology Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular Emergencies"},{"type":"p","text":"Cath labs can involve critically ill patients."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acute myocardial infarction"},{"text":"Cardiogenic shock"},{"text":"Cardiac arrest"},{"text":"Severe arrhythmias"},{"text":"Hypotension"},{"text":"Acute coronary syndrome"},{"text":"Contrast reactions"},{"text":"Bleeding"},{"text":"Vascular complications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency Response"},{"type":"h","text":"Become proficient in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BLS"},{"text":"CPR"},{"text":"Defibrillator operation within scope"},{"text":"Emergency equipment preparation"},{"text":"Code response"},{"text":"Patient monitoring"},{"text":"Rapid team communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"ACLS can become valuable depending on employer and clinical role."},{"type":"h","text":"Radiation Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Cath-lab technologists work around fluoroscopic radiation."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ALARA"},{"text":"Time"},{"text":"Distance"},{"text":"Shielding"},{"text":"Personal dosimetry"},{"text":"Radiation monitoring"},{"text":"Protective aprons"},{"text":"Thyroid protection"},{"text":"Radiation glasses"},{"text":"Ceiling-mounted shields"},{"text":"Table-side shields"},{"text":"Radiation exposure documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Principle"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiation Exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Time ↓"},{"type":"h","text":"Distance ↑"},{"type":"h","text":"Shielding ↑"},{"type":"h","text":"Occupational Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Equipment"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Imaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fluoroscopy"},{"text":"C-arm systems"},{"text":"Digital imaging"},{"text":"Angiography systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Monitoring"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ECG"},{"text":"SpO₂"},{"text":"NIBP"},{"text":"Invasive pressure monitoring"},{"text":"Hemodynamic recording"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Procedure Equipment"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Catheters"},{"text":"Guidewires"},{"text":"Introducer sheaths"},{"text":"Balloons"},{"text":"Stents"},{"text":"Contrast injectors"},{"text":"Manifolds"},{"text":"Pressure transducers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency Equipment"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Defibrillator"},{"text":"Temporary pacemaker"},{"text":"Crash cart"},{"text":"Suction"},{"text":"Oxygen"},{"text":"Emergency medications support equipment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the purpose and safety considerations of medications commonly encountered in cardiovascular procedures."},{"type":"h","text":"Examples include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Antiplatelet agents"},{"text":"Anticoagulants"},{"text":"Vasodilators"},{"text":"Sedation-related medicines"},{"text":"Emergency cardiovascular drugs"},{"text":"Contrast media"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The technologist should understand indications, preparation, monitoring, and safety procedures within their scope, while medication prescribing and administration responsibilities depend on the clinical team and institutional policy."},{"type":"h","text":"Contrast-Media Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contrast types"},{"text":"Contrast administration"},{"text":"Patient screening"},{"text":"Allergy/reaction history"},{"text":"Renal-risk considerations"},{"text":"Contrast reactions"},{"text":"Emergency response"},{"text":"Documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Recognize symptoms of serious contrast reactions and immediately escalate them to the clinical team."},{"type":"h","text":"Data & Digital Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern cath labs generate significant amounts of clinical and procedural data."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Clinical documentation"},{"text":"Electronic health records"},{"text":"Cath-lab information systems"},{"text":"Digital imaging systems"},{"text":"Basic data analysis"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Clinical workflow analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Advanced Cardiovascular Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Future cath labs will increasingly incorporate AI."},{"type":"h","text":"Understand applications in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coronary image analysis"},{"text":"Lesion detection"},{"text":"Vessel segmentation"},{"text":"Quantitative coronary analysis"},{"text":"Procedure planning"},{"text":"Risk prediction"},{"text":"Hemodynamic analysis"},{"text":"Workflow automation"},{"text":"Image enhancement"},{"text":"Radiation-dose optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future Skill Path"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Data"},{"type":"h","text":"AI / Machine Learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Interventional Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"}]},{"heading":"Cath-Lab Workflow Management Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Create a dashboard tracking:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procedure volume"},{"text":"Procedure duration"},{"text":"Equipment utilization"},{"text":"Patient turnaround"},{"text":"Radiation exposure"},{"text":"Complication documentation"}]}]},{"heading":"ECG Arrhythmia Classification","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a supervised-learning project for basic ECG rhythm classification using an appropriate public dataset."}]},{"heading":"Radiation Exposure Monitoring System","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design a digital system to monitor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Staff exposure"},{"text":"Procedure duration"},{"text":"Dose indicators"},{"text":"Safety compliance"}]}]},{"heading":"Cath-Lab Equipment Inventory System","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Build a system for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equipment tracking"},{"text":"Consumable inventory"},{"text":"Expiry monitoring"},{"text":"Maintenance schedules"}]}]},{"heading":"End-to-End PCI Workflow Study","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Document the complete process:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient with ACS"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiology Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Preparation"},{"type":"h","text":"Coronary Angiography"},{"type":"h","text":"Lesion Identification"},{"type":"h","text":"PCI"},{"type":"h","text":"Hemodynamic Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-Procedure Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Internship & Clinical Training Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical exposure should be a major component of the career pathway."},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 1 — Cardiac Hospitals"},{"type":"h","text":"Seek clinical training in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiology hospitals"},{"text":"Heart institutes"},{"text":"Tertiary-care hospitals"},{"text":"Medical college hospitals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 2 — Cath-Lab Rotation"},{"type":"h","text":"Aim for exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coronary angiography"},{"text":"PCI"},{"text":"Hemodynamic monitoring"},{"text":"Fluoroscopy"},{"text":"Sterile procedures"},{"text":"Emergency response"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 3 — Cardiac ICU"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ECG monitoring"},{"text":"Hemodynamics"},{"text":"Post-PCI care"},{"text":"Acute coronary syndrome"},{"text":"Emergency response"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 4 — Electrophysiology Lab"},{"type":"h","text":"If available, observe:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EP studies"},{"text":"Ablation"},{"text":"Pacemaker procedures"},{"text":"ICD procedures"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles after the appropriate recognized qualification and clinical training include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cath-Lab Technologist"},{"text":"Cardiac Cath-Lab Technologist"},{"text":"Cardiovascular Technologist"},{"text":"Cardiac Care Technologist"},{"text":"Interventional Cardiology Technologist"},{"text":"Cath-Lab Technician"},{"text":"Cardiovascular Procedure Technologist"},{"text":"Cardiac Technology Clinical Assistant"},{"text":"Cardiovascular Technology Trainee"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact titles and eligibility vary by institution and recruitment notification."},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer","High-Value Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Cardiac Hospital"},{"text":"Cath-lab workflow + sterile technique"}],[{"text":"Heart Institute"},{"text":"PCI + hemodynamics"}],[{"text":"Government Hospital"},{"text":"Clinical competency + documentation"}],[{"text":"Private Cardiac Centre"},{"text":"Cath-lab + emergency response"}],[{"text":"Medical College"},{"text":"Clinical + teaching/research"}],[{"text":"Medical Device Company"},{"text":"Equipment + applications"}],[{"text":"Cardiovascular Technology Company"},{"text":"Imaging + device knowledge"}],[{"text":"Research Centre"},{"text":"Cardiovascular data + research"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BLS"},{"text":"Infection-control training"},{"text":"Patient safety"},{"text":"Radiation safety"},{"text":"Basic ECG"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Clinical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ACLS"},{"text":"Hemodynamic monitoring"},{"text":"Cardiovascular emergency training"},{"text":"Cath-lab equipment training"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Healthcare data analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize recognized clinical training and hands-on competency over collecting generic online certificates."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on eligibility and university offerings:"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc Cardiovascular Technology"},{"text":"M.Sc Cardiac Technology"},{"text":"M.Sc Medical Technology"},{"text":"Advanced cardiovascular technology programs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Master of Public Health"},{"text":"Healthcare Management"},{"text":"Hospital Administration"},{"text":"Health Informatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biomedical Technology"},{"text":"Medical Technology"},{"text":"Healthcare Data Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant UG"},{"type":"h","text":"PG / Advanced Clinical Training"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"PhD / Advanced Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular Technology Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Specific postgraduate eligibility must be verified with the individual institution."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Interventional Cardiology Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coronary angiography"},{"text":"PCI"},{"text":"Complex coronary interventions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Structural Heart Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop expertise in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TAVR/TAVI"},{"text":"Mitral interventions"},{"text":"Structural heart procedures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Electrophysiology Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EP studies"},{"text":"Ablation"},{"text":"Pacemakers"},{"text":"ICDs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Hemodynamics Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pressure monitoring"},{"text":"Waveform analysis"},{"text":"Cardiovascular measurements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Cath-Lab Equipment Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop expertise in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fluoroscopy"},{"text":"Hemodynamic systems"},{"text":"Imaging equipment"},{"text":"Device integration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Clinical Applications Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with cardiovascular-device manufacturers and hospitals."},{"type":"h","text":"7. Cardiovascular Technology Researcher"},{"type":"h","text":"Work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical imaging"},{"text":"AI"},{"text":"Interventional devices"},{"text":"Cardiovascular data"},{"text":"Procedure optimization"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"UG Cardiac/CV Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Cath-Lab Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead Cath-Lab Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Technology Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Applications Path"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Applications Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Applications Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Technology Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular Technology Leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"EP Specialization"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"EP Lab Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"EP Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior EP Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"EP Lab Specialist / Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"The profession is likely to be influenced by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted coronary imaging"},{"text":"Robotic PCI"},{"text":"Robotic catheter systems"},{"text":"3D cardiovascular imaging"},{"text":"Advanced intravascular imaging"},{"text":"OCT"},{"text":"IVUS"},{"text":"FFR/iFR"},{"text":"Structural-heart technologies"},{"text":"Remote procedure support"},{"text":"Advanced hemodynamic analytics"},{"text":"Radiation-dose optimization"},{"text":"Digital cath-lab integration"},{"text":"Predictive cardiovascular analytics"},{"text":"AI-assisted workflow optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiac anatomy"},{"text":"Cardiac physiology"},{"text":"ECG"},{"text":"Cardiovascular pathology"},{"text":"Hemodynamics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coronary angiography"},{"text":"PCI workflow"},{"text":"Catheter/device familiarity"},{"text":"Fluoroscopy"},{"text":"Hemodynamic monitoring"},{"text":"Procedure documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient preparation"},{"text":"Sterile technique"},{"text":"Infection prevention"},{"text":"Emergency response"},{"text":"BLS/ACLS where appropriate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Safety"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Radiation protection"},{"text":"ALARA"},{"text":"Contrast safety"},{"text":"Sharps safety"},{"text":"Equipment safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cath-lab imaging"},{"text":"Hemodynamic systems"},{"text":"Digital cardiovascular records"},{"text":"Equipment troubleshooting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Healthcare analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted imaging"},{"text":"Cardiovascular image processing"},{"text":"Robotic intervention awareness"},{"text":"Digital health"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"h","text":"A strong graduate should demonstrate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Recognized Cardiac/CV Technology Qualification"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Clinical Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiac Anatomy & Physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"ECG & Hemodynamic Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Sterile Technique"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Equipment Knowledge"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"PCI Workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiation Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency Response"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Healthcare Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular Technology Awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Job-Ready Cath-Lab Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Recognized Cardiac/CV/Cath-Lab Technology degree","intensive cath-lab clinical training","ECG + hemodynamics + sterile technique + radiation safety","coronary angiography/PCI exposure","specialization in interventional cardiology, electrophysiology or structural heart","senior/lead or clinical-applications pathway"],"label":"Best pathway"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest employability combination is hands-on cath-lab competency + cardiovascular knowledge + strict procedural safety + hemodynamic monitoring + familiarity with modern interventional imaging and devices."}]}]}